      "exercise": "205",
      "a)": "If natural numbers here are 1,2,3,..., the initial terms are 4,8,12,16,20,... and z_n=4n. If zero is included, the initial terms are 0,4,8,12,16,... and z_n=4(n-1). Neither convention is silently imposed by the supplied definition.",
